8. CONCLUSION: THE CROWN JEWEL
Aerospace certification is the gold standard. If an architecture can pass DO-178C, it can
pass anything.
ST-T1024 provides a path to DO-178C certification that does not require:
· Amendments to the standard
· Probabilistic safety margins
· Exceptions for neural networks
· "Confidence scores" as a substitute for determinism
Instead, it provides:
· ✅ Deterministic execution
· ✅ Auditable state transitions
· ✅ Physically bounded timing (AET)
· ✅ Formal verifiability
· ✅ Open, sovereign implementation
The standard is open. The repository is complete. The knowledge is public.
Aerospace can now certify.
